<ui:UXML xmlns:ui="UnityEngine.UIElements" xmlns:uie="UnityEditor.UIElements" xsi:schemaLocation="UnityEngine.UIElements ../../UIElementsSchema/UnityEngine.UIElements.xsd" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" editor-extension-mode="False">
    <Style src="project:/Assets/UI/Styles/GlobalStyles.uss" />
    <ui:VisualElement name="overlay" class="overlay" style="z-index: 200;">
        <ui:VisualElement name="popup" class="card" style="width: 85%; max-width: 600px; padding: 60px; align-items: center;">
            <ui:Label name="logout-title" text="DANG XUAT?" style="font-size: 54px; -unity-font-style: bold; color: #461A42; margin-bottom: 30px;" />
            <ui:Label name="logout-msg" text="Ban co chac chan muon dang xuat khong?" style="font-size: 30px; color: #666; -unity-text-align: middle-center; white-space: normal; margin-bottom: 50px;" />
            
            <ui:VisualElement name="button-row" style="flex-direction: column; width: 100%;">
                <ui:Button name="confirm-logout-btn" text="XAC NHAN" class="btn btn-danger" style="height: 100px; font-size: 36px; margin-bottom: 20px;" />
                <ui:Button name="cancel-logout-btn" text="HUY" class="btn" style="height: 90px; font-size: 32px; background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border-width: 0;" />
            </ui:VisualElement>
        </ui:VisualElement>
    </ui:VisualElement>
</ui:UXML>
